@startuml
title ArcadeHaven - Physical Deployment View (Docker)

skinparam backgroundColor #f4f4f4
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

node "Host Machine / VM" {
  node "Docker Network: arcadehaven-net" {
    node "Container: arcadehaven-api" as API {
      component "Spring Boot API" as APP
      component "JWT/Auth/RBAC" as SEC
      component "Application Logging" as ALOG
    }

    node "Container: arcadehaven-db" as DB {
      database "PostgreSQL" as PG
    }
  }

  folder "Docker Volume: db-data" as V_DB
  folder "Docker Volume: app-uploads" as V_FILES
}

cloud "Internet" as NET
cloud "RAWG API" as RAWG
actor "Client (Browser/Postman)" as CLIENT

CLIENT --> NET
NET --> API : HTTPS / REST
API --> RAWG : Outbound HTTPS
APP --> PG : JDBC / SQL
DB --> V_DB
API --> V_FILES

note right of API
Physical controls to enforce:
- TLS termination and secure transport
- Secret injection via environment variables
- Least privilege container runtime
- Non-root execution
- Health checks and restart policy
end note

note bottom
This physical view is intentionally deployment-focused:
- API in one Docker container
- Database in one Docker container
- Persistent volumes for DB and file storage
- Database is internal-only (not exposed externally)
end note

@enduml
